Package: argon-oneup-battery
Version: 1.2.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: hardware
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: dkms, device-tree-compiler, i2c-tools
Recommends: linux-headers-rpi-2712 | linux-headers-raspi | linux-headers-arm64 | linux-headers-rpi-v8 | linux-headers-generic, lm-sensors
Description: Argon ONE UP Laptop Battery & Power Management Driver
 Native Linux kernel power_supply driver for the Argon ONE UP
 Raspberry Pi CM5 laptop battery management IC (0x64).
 Exposes BAT0 (percentage, voltage, current, power, temperature,
 cycle count, health, dynamic battery runtime) and AC0 (online status)
 to the desktop environment (UPower, systemd-logind, desktop panels).
 Includes DKMS automatic build, Device Tree overlay, and config.txt auto-configuration.
